.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり自分で言うのもなんだけど、顔はちょっと大人っぽくなったよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クククッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長エピソード"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武ドーム見に来てくれたお母さんから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛をの歌の時、歩き方がおかしかったね  って言われたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いた方いたかな～⁉︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は狼に口笛をの時の衣装なんだけど、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの当時のままの衣装と靴なの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから背が伸びてるし、足もsize変わってるからなの‥‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服の丈が短いし、靴の中は指曲げて履いてて大変な事になってるの‥‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから歩きにくかったなぁ～‥(๑⃙⃘•ㅅ•๑⃙⃘)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当時の衣装を着ると、中学1年～高校1年生で成長したんだな～って思います。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のアンダー曲はもう聞いてくれたかな？センターは、めいちゃん（中元日芽香）だよ～^o^わ～い！*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVEもあるし、来て良かった～！\nまた来たい！って思ってもらえるように頑張ります‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、メンバーやスタッフさんダンスの先生に\nファンの方からもダンスを褒めてもらう事が増えたので、もっと楽しんでもらえるようにレッスンも頑張ります！！\n見にきてね(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校は小テストが多くて大変‥\nもうすぐ期末テストだ‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｲｼﾞｲｼﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生の皆さん！一緒に頑張ろう～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/4